---
/* Privacy — Monkkee-style 3-pillar layout with SVG illustrations */
---

<section class="privacy" id="privacy">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="priv-title">Your Journal, Your Rules</h2>
    <p class="priv-subtitle">We believe your private thoughts should stay private. Period.</p>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-illustration">
          <svg width="180" height="160" viewBox="0 0 180 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <!-- Background padding (similar to other icons) -->
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="180" height="160" fill="transparent"/>

            <!-- Document/Notebook (smaller size) -->
            <rect x="45" y="30" width="90" height="100" rx="6" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2"/>

            <!-- Document binding on right (smaller) -->
            <rect x="135" y="35" width="8" height="90" rx="2" fill="#CBD5E1"/>

            <!-- Document lines (text content - smaller and fewer) -->
            <rect x="52" y="45" width="25" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="82" y="45" width="45" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="55" width="18" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="75" y="55" width="30" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="110" y="55" width="22" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="65" width="40" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="97" y="65" width="30" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="75" width="15" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="72" y="75" width="25" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="102" y="75" width="25" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="85" width="35" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="92" y="85" width="35" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="95" width="28" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="85" y="95" width="25" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <rect x="52" y="105" width="22" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="79" y="105" width="25" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>
            <rect x="109" y="105" width="18" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#64748B"/>

            <!-- Privacy indicator icon (eyes in center of notebook) -->
            <g transform="translate(90, 80)">
              <!-- Eye outline (made even larger) -->
              <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="16" ry="8" fill="none" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="2"/>
              <!-- Eye pupil (made even larger) -->
              <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="4" fill="#64748B"/>
              <!-- Privacy line (crossing out) -->
              <line x1="-18" y1="-10" x2="18" y2="10" stroke="#EF4444" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Secret &amp; Private</h3>
        <p>Ravel is private-only. There's no social feed, no followers, no way to make entries public. Your journal stays between you and you — just like a paper diary with a lock.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-illustration">
          <img src="/icons/secure-encrypted.svg" alt="Secure and encrypted shield illustration" width="180" height="160" />
        </div>
        <h3>Secure &amp; Encrypted</h3>
        <p>Every word is encrypted on your device before it ever touches the cloud. AES-256 + end-to-end encryption means even we can't read your thoughts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-illustration">
          <img src="/icons/access-internet.svg" alt="Access from any device illustration" width="180" height="160" />
        </div>
        <h3>Access Anywhere</h3>
        <p>Journal on your phone, tablet, or laptop. Your entries sync securely across all your devices — write at home, continue on the go. Works offline too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy {
    background: var(--paper-cream);
    padding: 80px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .priv-title {
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 40px;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .priv-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 12px auto 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 36px;
    margin-top: 56px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 8px;
  }

  /* Illustration container */
  .pillar-illustration {
    width: 180px;
    height: 160px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .pillar:hover .pillar-illustration {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
  }
  .pillar-illustration img,
  .pillar-illustration svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }


  .pillar h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .pillar p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 280px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy { padding: 56px 0; }
    .priv-title { font-size: 32px; }
    .pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .pillar-illustration { width: 150px; height: 130px; }
  }
</style>
